meta {
  name: Mapa por zona
  type: http
  seq: 8
}

get {
  url: {{bffUrl}}/organizaciones/mapa/zona?minLat=-35&maxLat=-34&minLng=-59&maxLng=-58
  auth: none
}

docs {
  Public. Map pins (APROBADA + SIN_RECLAMAR) inside a lat/lng box, i.e. a map viewport.
  Response data: `{ pins: [...], truncated: boolean }`, at most 500 pins; `truncated` is true when
  the box held more, so zoom in. All four params are required; lat in [-90, 90], lng in
  [-180, 180], min <= max, otherwise 400. Boxes crossing the antimeridian are not supported.
}
